{"id":"re_flexion","lemma":"réflexion","pos":"noun","rank":4009,"glosses":["reflection (in mirror)","thought, thinking","discussion, remark"],"ipa":"/ʁe.flɛk.sjɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/03/Fr-r%C3%A9flexion.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A9flexion.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"réflexions"},"formAudio":{"réflexions":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7b/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-0x010C-r%C3%A9flexions.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Le problème ne vaut pas la réflexion.","en":"The problem isn't worth consideration.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"problem"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to be worth","l":"valoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Je suis fatigué de toutes ces réflexions.","en":"I'm tired of all this nagging.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"tired"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"C'est une belle réflexion.","en":"That's a nice thought.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"handsome","l":"beau"},null]},{"text":"Votre idée mérite vraiment réflexion.","en":"Your idea is definitely worth thinking about.","words":[{"g":"your, belonging to you"},{"g":"idea"},{"g":"merit"},{"g":"truly"},null]},{"text":"Quelles sont tes réflexions à ce sujet ?","en":"What are your thoughts on this?","words":[{"g":"which","l":"quel"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"your"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,7,"about that"]]}]}